    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hydroplane is a 2-player local cooperative underwater defense game where two players work together to protect the ocean floor from toxic hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510030/extras/485a097e6c7c27e77a16519226e5d219.webp?t=1750459377\" width=275 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player controls a floor-bound geyser that shoots charged bubbles to entrap fish, while the other player controls a character (a diver or submarines) that collects those fish and launches them toward the falling barrels to destroy them before they hit the sea bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for as long as possible, earn scrap from destroyed hazards, and spend it on temporary upgrades or convert to permanent currency for unlocking new characters and their abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510030/extras/b32ccedb50810d3bcb974b8037b1c43e.webp?t=1750459377\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510030/extras/375dc52a02beb26d50ec0c3772f108f8.webp?t=1750459377\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510030/extras/d9382556cf520105a2d2035697f051d3.webp?t=1750459377\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510030/extras/cc302d29e1cf4942ed5ec3344bf946c7.webp?t=1750459377\" width=52 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local 2-player co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique playable characters with unique unlockable abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique combat system - entrap fish in bubbles and launch them as projectiles to destroy toxic barrels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental threats - If too many barrels hit the sea floor, the run ends and the game is over. Bosses and special hazards (such as underwater sea currents) ramp up the difficulty over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo mechanics - Hitting a launched fish with the geyser's bubbles changes their trajectory as well as powering them up for extra damage and scrap material</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run-based progression - Collect scrap from destroyed barrels to boost stats during the run, or convert it into permanent gears to unlock new characters and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Per-run powerups - Destroy falling car batteries and seashells for movement boosts and faster charge speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable sessions - Short, engaging gameplay loops that encourage experimentation and mastery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hydroplane is a tight, fast-paced couch co-op experience where timing, coordination, as well as quick thinking and upgrades are the key to surviving the rising tide of pollution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hydroplane is a 2-player local cooperative underwater defense game where two players work together to protect the ocean floor from toxic hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510030/extras/485a097e6c7c27e77a16519226e5d219.webp?t=1750459377\" width=275 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player controls a floor-bound geyser that shoots charged bubbles to entrap fish, while the other player controls a character (a diver or submarines) that collects those fish and launches them toward the falling barrels to destroy them before they hit the sea bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for as long as possible, earn scrap from destroyed hazards, and spend it on temporary upgrades or convert to permanent currency for unlocking new characters and their abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510030/extras/b32ccedb50810d3bcb974b8037b1c43e.webp?t=1750459377\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510030/extras/375dc52a02beb26d50ec0c3772f108f8.webp?t=1750459377\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510030/extras/d9382556cf520105a2d2035697f051d3.webp?t=1750459377\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510030/extras/cc302d29e1cf4942ed5ec3344bf946c7.webp?t=1750459377\" width=52 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local 2-player co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique playable characters with unique unlockable abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique combat system - entrap fish in bubbles and launch them as projectiles to destroy toxic barrels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental threats - If too many barrels hit the sea floor, the run ends and the game is over. Bosses and special hazards (such as underwater sea currents) ramp up the difficulty over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo mechanics - Hitting a launched fish with the geyser's bubbles changes their trajectory as well as powering them up for extra damage and scrap material</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run-based progression - Collect scrap from destroyed barrels to boost stats during the run, or convert it into permanent gears to unlock new characters and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Per-run powerups - Destroy falling car batteries and seashells for movement boosts and faster charge speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable sessions - Short, engaging gameplay loops that encourage experimentation and mastery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hydroplane is a tight, fast-paced couch co-op experience where timing, coordination, as well as quick thinking and upgrades are the key to surviving the rising tide of pollution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
